#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC115.rude:2
msgid ""
"I've heard stories about the ghost and scary monsters that inhabit the Chasm of the Dead.  There's also supposed to be great treasure in there, too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC115.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC391.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Unarmed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC115.rude:4
msgid ""
"That's the old burial ground of the ancient ones!  I don't know who they were, but they were supposed to have marvelous things!  I wonder if it's all been looted or not?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC115.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about Kirkogaard Koenug?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC115.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC391.rude:3
msgid "Find Sigre Bjarnidotir in Thjorgard.  She will help you."
