"I've got hands of gold!  Everywhere I go, I find gold.  I just wish I wouldn't get robbed so much!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC116.rude:4
msgid ""
"Go hire yourself a fighter!  The crime around here is crazy!  I wish I had enough money to hire one!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC116.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about protection?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC116.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC84.rude:10
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC99.rude:9
msgid "Thanks for your time"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC117.rude:1
msgid ""
"My friend told me that Sigmund the Stressed wants the Crona Kiga so he can become king of all Chedian!  He thinks the King's Crown will make him the rightful ruler of us.  I tell you, a silly hat doesn't make someone a ruler!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC117.rude:3
msgid ""
"It's the crown worn by the Old Ursanian Emperors.  It is sometimes called the King's Crown.  Rumor is, that it is somewhere in the Chasm of the Dead."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC117.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about the Crona Kiga?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC117.rude:5
msgid ""
"I hear there's some gang that's been terrorizing the road to the village."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC117.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC121.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC122.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:18
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC69.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC93.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Drangheim?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC118.rude:2
msgid ""
"I will be going to the Thing soon.  My brother stole my chickens and I want them returned!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC118.rude:4
msgid ""
"The Thing is where you go when someone has committed crimes against you.  There are no weapons or fighting allowed there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC118.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about the Thing?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC118.rude:6
msgid ""
"Stay away from the Chasm of the Dead!  There's foul things in there that will kill you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC118.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about staying alive?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC119.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC119.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC397.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC397.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:5
msgid "If you are worthy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC119.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Blade."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC119.rude:2
msgid ""
"Do yourselves a favor, and get the best weapons you can buy.  Your spine will thank you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC119.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Blade."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC119.rude:4
msgid ""
"I once had my hands on Jorhgamesh, the finest blade in the world!  One day I fell off my horse and was knocked unconscious.  When I woke up it was gone!  What I wouldn't give for that sword back!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC119.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about blades?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC119.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:4
msgid "Look for Cinnfhail A'Mor in Thjorgard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC119.rude:5
msgid "Where do we become Grandmasters in Blade?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC119.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC148.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC222.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC285.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC287.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC397.rude:6
msgid "We'd like to ask you some questions"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC119.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC359.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC359.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:16
msgid "See you around."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC12.rude:2
msgid "I'm afraid not, sorry.  Perhaps you could buy something?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC12.rude:3
msgid "I wouldn't blame him then."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC12.rude:3
msgid ""
"Nor I.  This is going to drive up the prices of Elemental Thjorad!  That means the Thjoradric Smiths are going to charge ten times their normal prices!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC12.rude:4
msgid ""
"They've all stopped working!  If I were Sven, I wouldn't be too pleased with them either!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC12.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC24.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:2
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC12.rude:5
msgid "Here you are.  Pleasant shopping!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC12.rude:6
msgid "I heard Sven Forkbeard is very upset at the Thjorardic Miners."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC12.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:8
msgid "We're closed.  Come back tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC12.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:9
msgid "Come back when you are."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC12.rude:8
msgid "Not interested.  Sorry"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:10
msgid "No, but we would like to."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:10
msgid ""
"The Great Honk is the key to your salvations!  Without him, we will all be lost!  Praise the Great Honk!  Praise Philacte Canagica!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:11
msgid ""
"Our church was formed in 465 by our prophet Philacte Canagica.  He has achieved redemption and has been reincarnated as a goose!  Isn't that wonderful?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC270.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC82.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about the Temple of Honk?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:12
msgid "With the Great Honk's blessings, I shall answer them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:13
msgid "We have spoken to the Great Honk himself!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:13
msgid "What?  Don't say such blasphemous things!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:14
msgid "Get away from us you zealous freak!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:14
msgid "The Great Honk's blessings upon you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:15
msgid "The glory of Honk be upon you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:2
msgid "Alright.  If you think that makes you happy.  Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:2
msgid "May the Honk's Blessings be upon you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:3
msgid ""
"That is the lifestyle most of the Honkers have adopted.  We do not get agitated.  We just rise up over the adversity!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:3
msgid "What is the Way of the Bread?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:4
msgid ""
"If the Great Honk did not preach the Way of the Bread, I would punch you in the nose for that!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:4
msgid "You are a freak!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:5
msgid ""
"He is our glorious prophet!  He has ascended to Goosedom!  I just wish I knew what goose he has become!  Oh, but the rewards I would get for that!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:5
msgid "Who is Philacte Canagica?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:6
msgid "He's actually just the gods' pet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:6
msgid "LA! LA! LA! LA!  I can't hear you!!  Go away!!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:7
msgid "He's a cute little thing.  His name is Philip."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:7
msgid "I'm not listening!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:8
msgid "It's true!  We visited with him when we were in Arslegard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:8
msgid "Now I know you're lying!  No one can come back from Arslegard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC120.rude:9
msgid ""
"The Temple of Honk is always accepting new members.  I think you and your souls would very much like to be members."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC121.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC207.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC247.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC253.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC271.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC342.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC344.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC346.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC349.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC54.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:8
msgid "Certainly!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC121.rude:2
msgid ""
"It's a wonderful place to live!  I wish it was Drangheim everywhere!  Wouldn't that be grand?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC121.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:19 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC155.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC155.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC157.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC348.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:9
msgid "Farewell!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC122.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC169.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC331.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC353.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC81.rude:2
msgid "I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC122.rude:2
msgid ""
"It's not as good as it used to be.  Ever since Sigmund became Jarl things have been going downhill.  At least his father captured General Ivsar!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC123.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC123.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC124.rude:1
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC124.rude:3
msgid "Do you think you're worthy?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC123.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Cudgel."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC123.rude:2
msgid ""
"I Haven't heard anything interesting these days.  But my friend in Framon said his village was attacked a few days gone!  He'd never seen these men before.  They were neither Thronish nor Framish!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC123.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:4
msgid ""
"Go to Thjorgard.  Find someone named Gjerta Headstrong.  She shouldn't be too difficult to find.  She will instruct you further."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC123.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:4
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Cudgel?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC123.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:5
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Cudgel."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC123.rude:5
msgid ""
"I think that my brother picked up a case of Beldonia on his last sea voyage.  It was awful!  He had hives for a week!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC123.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:13
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC40.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:12
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC60.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC98.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about Beldonia?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC124.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC390.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Armsmaster."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC124.rude:2
msgid "Not that you would be interested in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC124.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC390.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Armsmaster."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC124.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC162.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC314.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:21 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC79.rude:5
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC124.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC247.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC315.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC325.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC330.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC331.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:10
msgid "What do you know about Framon?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC124.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC390.rude:3
msgid "Find Cihu'aton Pa'pan in Thjorgard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC124.rude:5
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Armsmaster?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC124.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC137.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC392.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC405.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC412.rude:4
msgid "Ask."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:10
msgid "If that's the way you want to act about it, Fine!  See you around."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:10
msgid "We no longer need your help."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:11
msgid "See that you don't."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:11
msgid "Sorry to bother you sir."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:2
msgid "A mere pittance.  You're hired."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:2
msgid "You shall be glad to have me guarding your back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:3
msgid "1000 gold per month plus 5% of any gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:2
msgid "What do you charge?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:4
msgid ""
"One might call me an assassin.  As I have said, however, I am not cheap."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:4
msgid "So you're for hire.  Tell us, what is your occupation?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:5
msgid "Can you back up that talk?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:5
msgid "I possess the skills to, yes.  But not many can afford me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:6
msgid "I'd say it's already found you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:6
msgid "What do you mean by that?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:7
msgid "I doubt that you are that valuable."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:7
msgid "Perhaps you will be able to afford me one day, and will see."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:8
msgid "Nothing.  Nevermind"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:8
msgid "See that you're careful."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC125.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC148.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC232.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC236.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC314.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC369.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC406.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC79.rude:1
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:10
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:1
msgid "Really?  You'll take me on your adventure?  Great!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:1
msgid "Sounds like a deal to us!  Let's go."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:10
msgid "Come back if you're bored like me!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:10
msgid "We don't have time to entertain you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:11
msgid "I have plenty of it to give!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:2
msgid ""
"I am a banker!  I can increase the riches you find by 20%!  I couldn't do it for free, though.  I would need at least 700 gold per month, plus 10% of all the gold we find!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:2
msgid "Perhaps we could come to an arrangement.  What can you do?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:3
msgid "I am but a banker.  I could not survive on my own."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:3
msgid "Why don't you seek adventure, then?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:4
msgid ""
"I'm so bored here I could just spit!  Sitting behind this desk is not the most exciting place to be, you know!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:5
msgid ""
"I am!  I have a thirst for adventure that cannot be quenched behind a desk."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:5
msgid "You look bored."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:6
msgid "Maybe you'll find some sucker who will pay you that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:7
msgid ""
"Only everything there is!  Why, with my knowledge, I could make you rich!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about banking?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:8
msgid "Please do!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:9
msgid ""
"Very well, I understand.  I'm not really that useful.  I shall be around, if you need me again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC126.rude:9
msgid "Your services are no longer required."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:1
msgid ""
"It has?  Oh.  Well when that decision is made, keep me in mind.  I am probably the most qualified general in all of Chedian."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:1
msgid "The leader has yet to be decided."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:10
msgid "Markel the Great and his soldiers will be ready for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:10
msgid "We shall.  We'll be in touch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:11
msgid ""
"Uniting the clans is a fine and noble cause.  I shall be of aid to you, however there are two things which you must do for me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:11
msgid "We need to unite the clans against Tamur Leng."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:12
msgid ""
"Don't dawdle about it either!  Markel the Great does not like dawdlers!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:12
msgid "Yes, sir!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:13
msgid ""
"Markel the Great will let them know.  He will see you at the war council!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:13
msgid "Tell them we will meet in Thronheim in two weeks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:14
msgid ""
"Never mind, Markel the Great doesn't really want to know.  As Markel the Great is a great leader, he will reward you well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:14
msgid "We.."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:28 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:17 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:30
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:15
msgid "Was there anything else Markel the Great can do for you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:41 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC279.rude:7
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:14
msgid "We need your help."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:16
msgid ""
"What?  A problem for the glorious Markel the Great to solve?  What is the problem?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:18
msgid ""
"Hm.  That is his sigil all right.  So you have.  That is good news for you.  I am certain he did not reward you for beating him, so I shall.  Markel the Great always rewards his heroes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:18
msgid "We did.  He gave us this letter to prove it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:19
msgid ""
"It is alright to fear Markel the Great.  Come back when you are braver."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:19 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:26 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:14
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:13 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:45 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:46
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:36 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:14
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Perhaps some other time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:11
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:5
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:20
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:15
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:6
msgid "We will do this for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:20 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:33
msgid ""
"Markel the Great has heard wonderful news on this day!  He will dispatch word to the other Jarls immediately!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:20 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:28 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:35
msgid "The clans are united.  It is time for the war council"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:21
msgid ""
"I see the Dook has put the fear into you as well.  Should you regain your nerve,  Markel the Great will be happy to allow you to do this for him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:21
msgid "We can't be bothered with that right now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:22 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:24
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:1
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:1
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:1
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:18 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:26
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC279.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:11
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:10
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:13 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC284.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:32
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:17
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:3
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:22
msgid "Was there anything else Markel the Great can help you with?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:23
msgid ""
"For me to trust your ability and worth, you must beat Ivan the Smart.    Go to the Gathering, find Ivan the Smart and challenge him to an intellectual contest.  When you beat him, return to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:23 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:21
msgid "What is the second thing you need done?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:24
msgid "We've already got that book."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:24
msgid "You have?  What are you doing with it?  Never mind!  Give it here!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:25
msgid "About those things you wanted us to do.."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:26
msgid "Markel the Great will still be here when you've got more nerve."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:27
msgid ""
"In fact, there is.  There is a man who has come to Guberland who calls himself the Dook.  He has refused to acknowledge my sovereignty and has been an ever increasing thorn in my side."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:27 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:44
msgid "Is there anything we can do for you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:29
msgid "We've got the Book of Rules."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:29
msgid "You've got it??  How did you..?  Never mind.  Quick give it here!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:3
msgid ""
"Markel the Great would reward you greatly if you would find a way to rid me of him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:3
msgid "What would you have us do?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:30
msgid "We've beaten Ivan the Smart."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:30
msgid "What?!  That's impossible!  No one has ever beaten him before."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:31
msgid "Markel the Great would be happy to lead your armies."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:32
msgid "He is?  What did you do to get rid of him?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:32
msgid "The Dook is finished."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:33 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:25 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:39
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:44
msgid "The Clans are united.  It is time for the war council."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:34
msgid ""
"That's not the answer I want to hear!  You go back and get rid of him!  Markel the Great does not have time to waste on people such as him!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:34
msgid "The Dook says he won't leave."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:35
msgid ""
"Do you not think I had an interest in that battle?  Do you think that I wasn't betrayed by its outcome?  My people as much as anyone else's are in danger."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:35
msgid "Markel?  Why are you here?  You weren't killed in the battle!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:36
msgid "The glorious Markel the Great bids you farewell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:4
msgid "Thank you.  Return to Markel the Great for your reward."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:4
msgid "We shall get rid of him for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:5
msgid ""
"If we are to do battle with this man, Tamur Leng, we need a book.  The book on combat.  It is called the Book of Rules, written by the famous warrior Monte.  It is kept in the Ta'Sar Academy in Lindisfarne."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:10
msgid "What is the first thing you need done?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:6
msgid "Go, warriors.  We are all counting on you to succeed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:6
msgid "Yes, that is true.  Their suffering is our responsibility."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:7
msgid "Here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:7
msgid ""
"Wonderful!!  This is..great!  Here's a reward.  Markel the Great always rewards his heroes!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:8
msgid ""
"Good luck.  And you will need it.  Ivan the Smart is very intelligent!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:9
msgid "Markel the Great would be happy to lead your armies!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:31 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC127.rude:9
msgid "Now that we've done these things for you, will you join us?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:10
msgid ""
"Should they become worthy, seek me out.  I shall task you with this quest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:10
msgid "We don't have any that are worthy right now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:12
msgid "That's good news.  I hereby promote you to Healers.  Congratulations."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:12
msgid "We've healed Nurtigan."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:2
msgid "Thank you for healing Nurtigan.  Farewell"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:3
msgid ""
"I once promoted a man who turned on me!  After he acquired his promotion, he tried to kill me!  Can you believe that?  Of course I had to kill him.  It was just horrible."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:4
msgid "Good luck.  Come back to me when he is cured."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC4.rude:5
msgid "We will take this quest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:5
msgid ""
"Speak to Skarphedinn Njalssen in the apothecary.  He will be able to tell you how to make an antidote for his nuttiness."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:59
msgid "What do you want us to do?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:6
msgid ""
"As I am sure you have noticed, we have a man by the name of Nurtigan in our Idiot's Box.  He has been made nutty by the Old Hag who lives in the caves near here.  We need his strength to protect the town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:6
msgid "We have worthy Initiates."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:7
msgid ""
"If there are Initiates worthy among you, I have a task that needs to be done."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:7
msgid "We are seeking promotion from Initiate to Healer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:8
msgid ""
"Promotions are the only way to move up in the world.  Trust me.  If you are looking to have an impact in the world, I suggest you seek them out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:8
msgid "What do you know about promotions?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:9
msgid "Very well.  Return to me when you are able."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC128.rude:9
msgid "We can't do this right now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:1
msgid ""
"It's a shame that we lost our temple.  I would be willing to promote a Healer to a Priest if they would build a new church."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:10
msgid "I can promote any worthy Healers in your party to Priests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:10
msgid "We are seeking promotion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:11
msgid ""
"We lost our temple.  It is a tragic shame.  Now we have no where to gather for worship, and none of our elders seem interested in building a new one!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC143.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about temples?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:12
msgid "Farewell, then.  Come back when you are."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:12
msgid "We're not ready to be promoted yet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:13
msgid ""
"For the temple to truly be a holy place, the ground must be consecrated.  It's been so long since it has been done, I cannot remember how.  You must find Nath'i A'Mor.  He is probably the only priest who remembers how."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:13
msgid "What is the final thing?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:14
msgid "About the new temple."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:15
msgid "Brave and noble indeed.  Good luck"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:15
msgid "We will do these things."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:16
msgid ""
"That is great news indeed!  You have done us all a great service.  I hereby promote you to Priests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:16
msgid "We've completed all your tasks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:18
msgid "Farewell, and good luck!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:2
msgid ""
"There are three things that need to be done before we can begin construction of the New Temple."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:2
msgid "We would like to be promoted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:3
msgid ""
"I am too old for the job of high priest.  It is time for some new blood in Guberland.  You must find us a young new priest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:3
msgid "What is the first thing?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:5
msgid ""
"I don't know.  Why don't you try visiting all the temples in Chedian.  Perhaps even Lindisfarne."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:5
msgid "Where are we to find a new priest?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:6
msgid ""
"The last I heard, he became a missionary to try and convince the Frosgardians to come back to the Beliefs.  Ghastly Heathens!  It's no wonder that they live in such a horrid place!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC40.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:9
msgid "Where can we find him?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:8
msgid ""
"Thank you!  People will be worshipping at this church for years to come."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:9
msgid ""
"All temples need a holy icon.  There is an ancient temple in Frosgard that has an icon known as the Tree of Life.  Find this and bring it to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC129.rude:9
msgid "What is the second thing?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:10
msgid ""
"An Orb of Linking?!  I didn't know those things actually existed!  Please, go right ahead!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:10
msgid "We're here to install an Orb of Linking into your bank."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:11
msgid ""
"I hear the gods extract a heavy toll for those who are sent back from Hallenhalt.  If I were one of those people, I would put my money in a bank."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:2
msgid "Any more news?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:2
msgid "No, sorry.  Except that the bank is the safest place for your money."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:3
msgid ""
"Krohn is the king of the gods.  He is the one who told Bori to build Hallenhalt in Arslegard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:3
msgid "Who is Krohn?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:4
msgid ""
"Hallenhalt is the place where people who have died in battle go.  I've heard that Krohn is building an army of dead soldiers to fight for him someday."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:4
msgid "Hallenhalt?  What is that?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:6
msgid "We would like to do some banking."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:7
msgid ""
"Yes, that's right.  The Great Reckoning.  The day when even the gods themselves have to atone for their lives."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:7
msgid "You mean for the Great Reckoning?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:9
msgid "How is the Orb of Linking working?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC13.rude:9
msgid "Wonderfully!  Thank you for installing it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:1
msgid "Alright, let's have it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:1
msgid ""
"Okay, If you can answer this, I will concede defeat and give you a letter of victory suitable for framing:  Who is the smartest man ever?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:10
msgid "Alright, ask your questions."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:10
msgid ""
"Question one.  What two nations are most often at war with each other?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:11
msgid "I think a pig is smarter than you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:11
msgid "Trislan."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:12
msgid "Ha Ha!!!  You're so dumb!  I bet you thought you were going to win!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:12
msgid "Markel the Great."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:13
msgid "If you wish."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:13
msgid "Very well, I accept."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:14
msgid "To the death?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:15
msgid "As a token of good faith, we'll let you live."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:15
msgid "Wonderful!  I must admit, that I was worried there for a moment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:11
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC154.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:15
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC382.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC64.rude:1
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC93.rude:7
msgid "Goodbye!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:16
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "See you around."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:17
msgid ""
"I have news that you would neither be interested in, nor intelligent enough to understand."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:18
msgid "No it's not."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:18
msgid ""
"You don't like that dish?  Well the uneducated often have simple tastes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:19
msgid "It's not a dish!  It's a person.  He's the Prince of Beldonia!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:19
msgid ""
"Well don't you think you're so smart!  Beldonia isn't even a real place!  That's all just myth!  It died in the Great Cataclysm just like everything else."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:2
msgid ""
"Holy smokes!  Right again!  Alright, next question: Where do dead warriors go?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:2
msgid "Verhoffin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:20
msgid ""
"I'll not listen to that sort of talk.  Either you have something intelligent to discuss, or clear off!  Since I suspect the latter and not the former, good day to you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:20
msgid "When they come to take your home, maybe you will believe us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:21
msgid "Sturmford and Thjorgard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:22
msgid "Guberland and Drangheim"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:23
msgid ""
"Ask.  There is not a question that I do not know the answer to.  The real question is if you are worthy to hear the answer!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:24
msgid "Boy are you dumb!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:24
msgid "Freidmar."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:25
msgid "Arslegard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:25
msgid "Wrong!!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:26
msgid "Hubris."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:26
msgid ""
"Wrong!  Oh wait, that's the right answer!  Okay then, next question: What is Elemental Thjorad used for?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:27
msgid "Making Armor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:27
msgid "Perhaps you'd like to try again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:28
msgid "Haw!  Maybe you should go find an orc to converse with."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:28
msgid "He was killed in battle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:29
msgid ""
"Me?  I'm flattered that you think that!  In fact, I will concede defeat to you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:3
msgid "A contest?  You mean a challenge of wits?!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:3
msgid "Is that so?  Perhaps you would like to have a contest?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:30
msgid ""
"That is a fine dish!  It is made with artichokes and bread.  Why I had some at the Gathering last year that was just delicious!  I don't think the cook who makes it is around anymore.  It's really too bad, it was a delicious dish!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:30 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC159.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:19 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:29
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:25 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:15
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:21
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC60.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC99.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about Tamur Leng?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:31 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC149.rude:1
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:31
msgid "Verdanir."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:32
msgid "Is it possible for you to get any dumber?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:32
msgid "The Afterworld."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:33
msgid ""
"Right!  Maybe you're not so dumb.  Alright, next question: Who caused the Great Cataclysm?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:33
msgid "Sturmford and Drangheim"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:34
msgid ""
"Correct!  You're intellect is astounding!  Perhaps you are deserving of my respect!  If you think you're so smart then, then I've got another for you: How did Emperor Trislan die?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:34
msgid "Making Magic Items."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:35
msgid "He was murdered by his personal guards."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:35
msgid ""
"Who are you people?  How did you learn so much?  Perhaps one day we could resolve the philosophical troubles with the world!  Alright you've nearly exhausted my knowledge.  I have one final question for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:36
msgid "Tamur Leng."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:36
msgid "Wrong!  Phew!  I thought you almost had me there!  Haw Haw!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:37
msgid ""
"What you really mean is that you don't possess the intellect to engage me in intelligent conversation.  Very well, adieu."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:38
msgid "Jevar the Bastard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:38
msgid "Wrong again!  You dope!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:39
msgid "Perhaps when you're smarter we can have some engaging conversation."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:4
msgid "Come back when you're smarter!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:4
msgid "Gee, thanks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:6
msgid "Making Swords."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:21 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:22 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:12
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:17
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:18 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:20 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:21
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:24 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:25 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:26
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:27 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:28 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:29
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:31 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:32
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:33 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:34 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:9
msgid "Wrong!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:7
msgid "We lost?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:7
msgid ""
"Yes!  Now because I'm that much smarter than you, it would be unfair to kill you.  I'll let you get by with your lives this time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:8
msgid "A hunting accident."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:8
msgid "You dumbbell!  That's the wrong answer!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:9
msgid ""
"Alright, you think you're so smart!  I think I'll give you one that's not so easy: Who was the first Ursanian Emperor?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:9
msgid "Hallenhalt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:10
msgid ""
"Place okay is it.  Time for once walking and living.  Trading post now it.  Farndale to help me!  Heh heh!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:13
msgid "Wait!  Help need come back your I!!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:12
msgid "I will answer your questions."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:15
msgid "You're welcome.  Farewell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:2
msgid ""
"I spent some time in Farndale when I was younger.  That's way down in Mendossus.  I hear it's not such a nice place anymore."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:3
msgid "After that experience?  You bet!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:3
msgid "Promise us you'll not try to woo every girl you meet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:4
msgid "Feeling any better?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:4
msgid "Yeah!  Thanks!  That's much better!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:7
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:5
msgid "Your answer I will question."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:6
msgid "I questions answer will your."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:7
msgid "It's an okay place.  It's a nice place to live usually."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:8
msgid "Here, Nurtigan.  Drink this."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:8
msgid "Take I.  Drink will."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:9
msgid "Crazy witch court tried to I this.  She this made me way ."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:9
msgid "What happened to you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:10
msgid "Now go, and leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:2
msgid ""
"That I'll not tell.  Fear not.  I think Nurtigan is much better this way.  I'm through answering your questions.  Farewell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:2
msgid "Well which is it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:3
msgid ""
"Maybe I did nothing.  Maybe he just cannot believe that there is a woman who would resist him.  Or maybe the thought of courting me made him crazy.  Or maybe he just bothered me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:3
msgid "What did you do to him?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:4
msgid ""
"He thought he was some great symbol of love.  It was his claim that there was no woman who  could resist his wooing.  Well he found out that such a woman exists.  And I am she."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:4
msgid "What happened to Nutty Nurtigan?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:5
msgid "Questions?  I suppose I could hear them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:6
msgid "I live out in a cave!  How would I get any news?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:7
msgid "That old loon?  It was his own fault he got that way!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:7
msgid "We've come to ask you to cure Nutty Nurtigan."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:8
msgid ""
"Don't you dare speak that name!  Why I have my suspicions that she is not what she seems.  I wouldn't trust her to give me Njam's own luck!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:22 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:9
msgid "What do you know about Yrsa the Troll?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:9
msgid "Get out of here and leave me alone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:1
msgid ""
"I'm very interested in the games the other wizards came up with.  I'd like you to visit as many games as you can.  The more games you can report on for me, the more money I'll pay you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:8
msgid "What can we do for you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:10
msgid ""
"Games stimulate the imagination, and are proven to keep you young.  I'll see you when your old!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:10
msgid "We don't have time for silly games."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:11
msgid "Do you give out any prizes?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:11
msgid ""
"Well, I happen to have here this wonderful Capstone of Order in my possession.  If you can give to me the entire set of prizes here at the Gathering, I will trade you for them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:12
msgid "Great!  Here's the capstone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:12
msgid "We've got your set of prizes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:13
msgid ""
"Well, actually I'm looking for someone to star in the new trapeze act I'm starting.  They can't be anyone scruffy like you, though.  I'm looking for someone who looks brave and noble.  Like they could be a king!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:13
msgid "You're not looking for any help, are you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:14
msgid "Did Nicolai take the job?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:14
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I think he's going to work out fine.  For your effort, I've got a bit of a reward for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:15
msgid "We don't have time for games today."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:15
msgid "Why?  Are you afraid of losing?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:16
msgid "Would you like to play a game?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:17
msgid ""
"There's six of them.  The wooden sword, the wooden shield, the fur cap, the cloth gloves,   the quilted armor, and the fuzzy slippers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:17
msgid "What are the prizes you are looking for?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:2
msgid "Alright!  You just better hope it's still here!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:2
msgid "Well if we ever need a Capstone of Order, we'll be by."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:3
msgid "We may have just the person."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:3
msgid "You have?  Great!  Bring him down!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:4
msgid "Step right up!  You can buy a ticket from the ticket master."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to play a game."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:6
msgid "Great!  Come back when you're done."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:6
msgid "Sounds like fun."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:7
msgid ""
"I'd really like to know what sort of games the other wizards came up with this year."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC136.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC138.rude:5
