msgid ""
"Bill of Sale\n"
"\n"
"The Arslegard Bathhouse purchase by Jokull the Ugly for the sum of 40,000 gold.\n"
"The bathhouse was purchased \"As is\".  No guarantees are made about it's suitability for function."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/arslegardcity.lua:140
msgid ""
"Letter to Rocnir\n"
"\n"
"Rocnir,\n"
"You are a fool, aren't you?  Do you not know what is in the Dark Passageway?  There is a reason Krohn himself had difficulty going through it to meet the Wyrdes.  I am not going to pay for your funeral when you come back dead.  And don't give me that \"You're already dead\" excuse again, because I'm sure what's in there will find a way to make you dead permanently!\n"
"\n"
"Hafgrim"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/arslegardcity.lua:141
msgid ""
"Wanted Winemakers\n"
"\n"
