#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/lichlab.lua:249
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Transformer\n"
"\n"
"As I have told you all numerous times before, do not use the skeleton transformer to deposit your experimental waste!  On three occasions now, I've created skeletons who have extra arms growing out of where their eyesockets are, and one had a tentacle growing from its finger.  I am sure this is all amusing to the rest of you, but I will not tolerate it if I catch you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/lichlab.lua:250
msgid ""
"Scrap of Diary\n"
"\n"
"..I've secured the way to my domination!  I will create a giant army of skeletons.  The machine is here and in working order.  All I need is a constant supply of conscripts, and soon all will bow down to me!  I can nearly taste victory already.  The only one who might stand in my way is that lich who calls himself Pinky.  I am certain he has plans to conquer the world as well..dispatch him..everything would be easy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/lichlab.lua:251
msgid ""
"Elixir Instructions\n"
"\n"
"If you're planning to make a new batch of Elixir of Defidation, follow these instructions.  If you don't, you could have unpredictable results.\n"
"Step One:  Retrieve the Elixir Ingredients and a jar from the storeroom.  There should be plenty in Storeroom B next to the Observation Deck.\n"
"Step Two:  Place the ingredients in the cookpot in the center of the kitchen.  From this you will get a few vials of Elixir Fluid.\n"
"Step Three:  Take the Elixir Fluid to the burners, to refine it into the Elixir of Defidation.\n"
"Step Four:  Drink the elixir when you are ready to be transformed.\n"
"\n"
"Master-of-Liches"
msgstr ""

